abstract: >
  Research artifact accompanying the paper retargeting an LLM-guided,
  coverage-free grammar-fuzzing pipeline (originally evaluated on two C JSON
  parsers under a sanitizer-based crash oracle) at a memory-safe target --
  Dart JSON deserialization across four widely-used Flutter frameworks --
  replacing the crash oracle with cross-implementation differential
  divergence and a ground-truth numeric round-trip check.

